{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Step into a world where dreams and reality mix.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/5af6ec3a028ce4f363d3812f9ebcb32a.webp?t=1773133772\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/5af6ec3a028ce4f363d3812f9ebcb32a.poster.avif?t=1773133772\" class=\"bb_img\" width=350 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a boy trapped between waking life and a dream, exploring his memories each day.\u00a0Each day uncovers a different part of his life, from school and family to love and loss.\u00a0Your choices influence his journey: will he find hope and awaken, or remain lost in darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/c288ca4c3835036c8174c066f2a386a6.poster.avif?t=1773133772\" width=680 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/c288ca4c3835036c8174c066f2a386a6.webm?t=1773133772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/c288ca4c3835036c8174c066f2a386a6.mp4?t=1773133772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/457f8b8db7ee6b90088405cc8fe26400.webp?t=1773133772\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/457f8b8db7ee6b90088405cc8fe26400.poster.avif?t=1773133772\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=100 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-drawn environments that bring the boy\u2019s memories to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the boy's fate with your choices: confront trauma or remain stuck in the past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover flashbacks by becoming a ghost and witnessing moments from the boy\u2019s life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve simple puzzles and overcome challenges to progress through the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a soundtrack that contains 84 tracks and reflects the game\u2019s atmosphere, blending calm, energy, and emotion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Main routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option to reduce cutscenes' brightness/speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K-pop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/a79a0e63c27256e184a5ffd06a3aaa81.webp?t=1773133772\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247640/extras/a79a0e63c27256e184a5ffd06a3aaa81.poster.avif?t=1773133772\" class=\"bb_img\" width=70 height=100 /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3247640/bbf409308c03f04e5b7d174699a128e61fff0d6a.jpg"},{"name":"Where's the vending machine?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3247640/67fa74c6a9816366d268edcd8b656d42bdac8f57.jpg"},{"name":"Leaving home again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3247640/30a26cabe166009cf53b3c7c24b261ba5567dfe6.jpg